  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>J</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là trọng tâm các tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta lại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/96b429ab0e32e60a7adfde31913b773c38f35fe468ff3ea7e7a9e0fa30084b0e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
